    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.Second.copy — pandas 3.0.5 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.Second.copy#\n\n- Second.copy()#\n- Return a copy of the frequency. See also \n  - `tseries.offsets.Week.copy`\n  - Return a copy of Week offset.\n  - `tseries.offsets.DateOffset.copy`\n  - Return a copy of date offset.\n  - `tseries.offsets.MonthEnd.copy`\n  - Return a copy of MonthEnd offset.\n  - `tseries.offsets.YearBegin.copy`\n  - Return a copy of YearBegin offset.\n Examples >>> freq = pd.DateOffset(1) >>> freq_copy = freq.copy() >>> freq is freq_copy False",
    "markdown_length": 481,
